<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="description" content="Turn your next walk into photo quests, build a collection of your finds, and explore with friends. Inspired by New York City." />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#ffd510" />
    <meta property="og:title" content="Sidequests Early Access" />
    <meta property="og:description" content="Explore your surroundings, capture what you find, and build your collection. Join the private beta." />
    <meta property="og:image" content="https://pocketpowered.org/sidequests/assets/marketing-2026-09/play-feature-graphic.png" />
    <meta property="og:url" content="https://pocketpowered.org/sidequests/" />
    <meta property="og:image:alt" content="Sidequests: photo quests, starring our pigeon with a camera" />
    <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
    <title>Sidequests Early Access · Pocket Powered</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css?v=sidequests-skyline-card-2" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/sidequests/marketing-2026-09.css" />
    <script is:inline src="/sidequests/sidequests.js?v=sidequests-cta-scroll-1" defer></script>
  </head>
  <body class="sidequests-page">
    <header class="site-header shell">
      <a class="pocket-mark" href="/" aria-label="Pocket Powered home">
        <span class="pocket-mark__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span>POCKET POWERED</span>
      </a>
      <a class="text-link" href="#access">Get early access <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="sq-hero shell">
        <div class="sq-hero__copy">
          <div class="sq-identity"><img src="/sidequests/assets/marketing-2026-09/pigeon-icon.webp" alt="Sidequests pigeon holding a yellow camera" width="112" height="112" /><p class="brand-chip">SIDEQUESTS</p></div>
          <h1>Your next walk is full of sidequests.</h1>
          <p class="sq-hero__lede">Spot something worth noticing. Capture it, see how your photo meets the quest, and turn your find into a little win.</p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a class="button button--yellow" href="#access" data-smart-cta>Get early access</a>
            <a class="text-link" href="#how-it-works">See a find come to life <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <figure class="sq-capture-hero">
          <img src="/sidequests/assets/marketing-2026-09/03-result.webp" alt="A completed water tower find in Sidequests, with the captured photo and 60 XP earned" width="660" height="1434" fetchpriority="high" />
          <figcaption>A rooftop detail. A photo quest. A find worth keeping.</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </section>

      <section class="how-it-works sq-capture-flow" id="how-it-works" aria-labelledby="capture-title">
        <div class="shell">
          <div class="section-heading section-heading--center">
            <h2 id="capture-title">From “look at that” to “look what I found.”</h2>
            <p>Here’s one water tower’s journey from a photo to a completed sidequest.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="product-showcase" data-product-showcase aria-label="Capture, grading, and result">
            <figure class="product-showcase__step">
              <div class="product-showcase__shot">
                <img src="/sidequests/assets/marketing-2026-09/01-capture.webp" alt="The Sidequests camera with a rooftop water tower in frame and the required-photo checklist" width="660" height="1434" loading="lazy" />
              </div>
              <figcaption><span>01</span><h3>See it. Capture it.</h3><p>Use the quest checklist to frame your find. Review your photo before you submit it.</p></figcaption>
            </figure>
            <figure class="product-showcase__step">
              <div class="product-showcase__shot">
                <img src="/sidequests/assets/marketing-2026-09/02-verdict.webp" alt="The grading breakdown: rooftop water tower requirement met for 45 XP and skyline context bonus earned for 15 XP" width="660" height="1434" loading="lazy" />
              </div>
              <figcaption><span>02</span><h3>See what counts.</h3><p>Get a requirement-by-requirement breakdown, including any bonus details and the XP you earned.</p></figcaption>
            </figure>
            <figure class="product-showcase__step">
              <div class="product-showcase__shot">
                <img src="/sidequests/assets/marketing-2026-09/03-result.webp" alt="Completed water tower find with 60 XP earned and audience set to Just me" width="660" height="1434" loading="lazy" />
              </div>
              <figcaption><span>03</span><h3>Keep the little win.</h3><p>Save the moment in your collection, choose who can see it, and head out for your next find.</p></figcaption>
            </figure>
          </div>
          <div class="product-showcase__stepper" data-product-stepper aria-label="Walkthrough navigation">
            <button type="button" data-product-step-previous aria-label="Previous walkthrough step">←</button>
            <span class="product-showcase__step-count" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"><strong data-product-step-current>01</strong><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span data-product-step-total>03</span></span>
            <button type="button" data-product-step-next aria-label="Next walkthrough step">→</button>
          </div>
          <p class="sq-screen-note">App screens shown with a sample photo and demo results.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="pack-preview-section shell" aria-labelledby="pack-preview-title">
        <div class="section-heading pack-preview-heading">
          <p class="kicker">Choose a sidequest</p>
          <h2 id="pack-preview-title">Follow whatever catches your eye.</h2>
          <p>Every pack turns a different slice of the city into something worth noticing. Start quick, wander a park, or keep watch for a neighborhood cat.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="preview-pack-grid">
          <article class="preview-pack-card preview-pack-card--starter">
            <div class="preview-pack-card__art">
              <span class="preview-pack-label">QUICK START</span>
              <img src="/sidequests/assets/starter-pack.jpg" alt="Illustrated Starter Pack with city objects and photo cards" />
            </div>
            <div class="preview-pack-card__body">
              <h3>Starter Pack</h3>
              <p>Six quick photo quests that get you looking at familiar streets in a new way.</p>
              <p class="preview-pack-card__eyebrow">Example finds</p>
              <ul class="quest-examples" aria-label="Starter Pack example quests">
                <li>Subway entrance</li>
                <li>Street-name sign</li>
                <li>Something yellow</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="preview-pack-card preview-pack-card--park">
            <div class="preview-pack-card__art">
              <span class="preview-pack-label">CITYWIDE</span>
              <img src="/sidequests/assets/park-life.jpg" alt="Illustrated Park Life scene with a fountain, lamp, trees, and walking path" />
            </div>
            <div class="preview-pack-card__body">
              <h3>Park Life</h3>
              <p>Turn any neighborhood green space into a scavenger hunt for classic park details.</p>
              <p class="preview-pack-card__eyebrow">Example finds</p>
              <ul class="quest-examples" aria-label="Park Life example quests">
                <li>Entrance sign</li>
                <li>Chess table</li>
                <li>Drinking fountain</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="preview-pack-card preview-pack-card--feline">
            <div class="preview-pack-card__art">
              <span class="preview-pack-label">ONGOING</span>
              <img src="/sidequests/assets/feline-frenzy.jpg" alt="Illustrated city cats in windows, shops, and neighborhood scenes" />
            </div>
            <div class="preview-pack-card__body">
              <h3>Feline Frenzy</h3>
              <p>Collect respectful, candid cat sightings from sidewalks and public-facing spaces.</p>
              <p class="preview-pack-card__eyebrow">Example finds</p>
              <ul class="quest-examples" aria-label="Feline Frenzy example quests">
                <li>Window cat</li>
                <li>Shop cat</li>
                <li>Stoop cat</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="sq-more-finds shell" aria-label="Keep exploring with Sidequests">
        <figure>
          <img src="/sidequests/assets/marketing-2026-09/06-pack.webp" alt="Starter Pack in Sidequests showing photo quests and pack progress" width="660" height="1434" loading="lazy" />
          <figcaption><h2>A little direction for your next wander.</h2><p>Pick a pack, browse its quests, and follow whatever catches your eye. There’s no need to plan the whole day.</p></figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure>
          <img src="/sidequests/assets/marketing-2026-09/07-profile.webp" alt="Sidequests profile showing an explorer’s level, XP, and activity" width="660" height="1434" loading="lazy" />
          <figcaption><h2>Every find adds to your story.</h2><p>Your discoveries build a collection and earn XP along the way. See your progress, then find a reason to head out again.</p></figcaption>
        </figure>
      </section>

      <section class="access-section shell" id="access" aria-labelledby="access-title">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <p class="kicker">Join the field test</p>
          <h2 id="access-title">Choose your phone</h2>
          <p>Beta access is free. We’ll keep the steps here current as each store opens wider testing.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="access-grid">
          <article class="access-card access-card--android">
            <div class="access-card__topline">
              <span class="platform-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <img src="/sidequests/assets/platforms/android.svg" alt="" width="30" height="30" />
              </span>
              <span class="status-badge status-badge--live" data-android-status>OPEN NOW</span>
            </div>
            <h3>Android</h3>
            <p>Google requires a tester group before it unlocks the Play install link. Join once; updates then arrive through Google Play.</p>
            <ol class="access-steps">
              <li>
                <span>Join the tester group</span>
                <a class="button button--ink" href="/sidequests/go/android-group" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-android-group-link>Join Google Group</a>
              </li>
              <li>
                <span>Opt in and install</span>
                <a class="button button--yellow" href="/sidequests/go/android" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-android-play-link>Open Google Play</a>
              </li>
            </ol>
            <p class="fine-print" data-android-message>Use the same Google account for both steps. The group is self-join; no manual invitation is needed.</p>
          </article>

          <article class="access-card access-card--ios">
            <div class="access-card__topline">
              <span class="platform-icon platform-icon--apple" aria-hidden="true">
                <img src="/sidequests/assets/platforms/apple.svg" alt="" width="28" height="32" />
              </span>
              <span class="status-badge status-badge--live" data-ios-status>OPEN NOW</span>
            </div>
            <h3>iPhone</h3>
            <p>Install Apple’s TestFlight app, then open our public beta link. No invitation is needed.</p>
            <ol class="access-steps">
              <li>
                <span>Install Apple TestFlight</span>
                <a class="button button--paper" href="https://apps.apple.com/app/testflight/id899247664" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Download TestFlight</a>
              </li>
              <li>
                <span>Join the Sidequests beta</span>
                <a class="button button--purple" href="/sidequests/go/ios" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-ios-link>Open in TestFlight</a>
              </li>
            </ol>
            <p class="fine-print" data-ios-message>No email invitation is needed. Install TestFlight, open the public link, and accept the beta.</p>
          </article>
        </div>

        <div class="interest-signup" aria-labelledby="interest-signup-title">
          <div class="interest-signup__copy">
            <p class="kicker">Stay in the loop</p>
            <h3 id="interest-signup-title">Get Sidequests updates.</h3>
            <p>Leave your email and we’ll let you know when new builds, wider access, and launch news are ready.</p>
          </div>

          <form
            class="interest-form"
            data-interest-form
            data-interest-endpoint="https://ktrglbdocowhekhjfkir.supabase.co/functions/v1/subscribe-sidequests-updates"
          >
            <label for="sidequests-interest-email">Email address</label>
            <div class="interest-form__fields">
              <input
                id="sidequests-interest-email"
                name="email"
                type="email"
                autocomplete="email"
                inputmode="email"
                maxlength="254"
                placeholder="you@example.com"
                required
              />
              <button class="button button--yellow" type="submit" data-interest-submit>Keep me posted</button>
            </div>
            <div class="interest-form__honeypot" aria-hidden="true">
              <label for="sidequests-company-website">Company website</label>
              <input id="sidequests-company-website" name="company_website" type="text" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" />
            </div>
            <p class="interest-form__consent">We’ll only send Sidequests availability and product updates. Unsubscribe anytime. See our <a href="/sidequests/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
            <p class="interest-form__status" role="status" aria-live="polite" data-interest-status></p>
          </form>
        </div>

      </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="site-footer shell">
      <span>Sidequests is a Pocket Powered project.</span>
      <nav aria-label="Footer links">
        <a href="/sidequests/privacy/">Privacy</a>
        <a href="/sidequests/terms/">Terms</a>
        <a href="/sidequests/support/">Support</a>
      </nav>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
